<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Wheeled dual-arm picking robot, layout prototype. Units: metres, kg, radians.
     Arms: meshes, masses and inertias computed from printed-part CAD (PLA at 0.781 g/cm3 effective),
     STS3215 55 g (every joint, same servo as the SO-100), 6808 25 g, MGN9 rail 65 g, MGN9H 26 g, plus every screw and insert.
     Base, lift and carriage: primitive shapes with estimated masses.
     Joint limits are the collision-free ranges of the CAD minus a 5 deg margin. -->
